<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Rocket League - Speed Flip Training</Major>
    <Description>This macro performs an automatic Speed Flip in Rocket League, perfect for kickoffs or quick recoveries. Once activated, it executes a precise combination of jumps, directional inputs, and flip cancel timing to achieve the fastest possible diagonal flip. 

It’s ideal for players who want to practice or use a consistent Speed Flip without manual input. Works with PC (keyboard and mouse) setups. 

Safe for Free Play and training packs. Can be adjusted by changing delays to match personal timing preferences.
</Description>
    <Comment>This macro was created to help Rocket League players learn and practice the Speed Flip technique in a consistent way. It combines precise directional inputs, jumps, and flip cancel timing to perform the move perfectly every time. Tested in Free Play on PC with keyboard and mouse. Feedback from the community is welcome.
</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>RightDown 1
Delay 16 ms
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 16 ms
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 16 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 12 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 16 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 16 ms
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 11 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 400 ms
KeyUp 8 1
KeyUp 22 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rocket League</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>